	<string>UNMU needs access to your camera so you can take a profile picture.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>UNMU does not need microphone access; this is only declared because the camera component requires it on some iOS versions.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>UNMU needs access to your photos so you can choose a profile picture.</string>
	<key>NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</key>
	<string>UNMU asks for permission so we can recognize your device across sessions and improve the app. You can change this any time in iOS Settings → Privacy.</string>
